    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566490/extras/67821ed8316a203154fb7f1c5a01003e.avif?t=1748607983\" width=700 height=74 /></span><i>Blue Bird's Song</i> is a narrative experience. This is a dark fairy tale inspired by Charles Perrault\u2019s classic French tale <i>Blue Beard</i>. Discover Birdie\u2019s story and help her take charge of her destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Birdie, one of Jehann's daughters, falls in love with Jonas and dreams of living a wonderful life with him, like the romances in the books she's read.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566490/extras/7017d4c57dd6ace589ac00e07dcde6cf.poster.avif?t=1748607983\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566490/extras/7017d4c57dd6ace589ac00e07dcde6cf.webm?t=1748607983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566490/extras/7017d4c57dd6ace589ac00e07dcde6cf.mp4?t=1748607983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Unfortunately, this love story doesn\u2019t have a happy ending and turns into a nightmare between darkness and creatures of the night.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the three storylines to discover the full story of the characters and the universe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The end is not always the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is written in gothic narrative poetry, let the language enchant your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566490/extras/99d005a2750e6cc3550c545f144208de.avif?t=1748607983\" width=636 height=68 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566490/extras/67821ed8316a203154fb7f1c5a01003e.avif?t=1748607983\" width=700 height=74 /></span><i>Blue Bird's Song</i> is a narrative experience. This is a dark fairy tale inspired by Charles Perrault\u2019s classic French tale <i>Blue Beard</i>. Discover Birdie\u2019s story and help her take charge of her destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Birdie, one of Jehann's daughters, falls in love with Jonas and dreams of living a wonderful life with him, like the romances in the books she's read.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566490/extras/7017d4c57dd6ace589ac00e07dcde6cf.poster.avif?t=1748607983\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566490/extras/7017d4c57dd6ace589ac00e07dcde6cf.webm?t=1748607983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566490/extras/7017d4c57dd6ace589ac00e07dcde6cf.mp4?t=1748607983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Unfortunately, this love story doesn\u2019t have a happy ending and turns into a nightmare between darkness and creatures of the night.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the three storylines to discover the full story of the characters and the universe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The end is not always the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is written in gothic narrative poetry, let the language enchant your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566490/extras/99d005a2750e6cc3550c545f144208de.avif?t=1748607983\" width=636 height=68 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Dive into the shadows of this fairytale-like narrative experience with Birdie, making choices and helping her find freedom and light in the darkness. Love isn't always what it seems.",
